[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4319625049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118950#issuecomment-4319625049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118950","id":4319625049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAXg_WQ","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-25T12:36:09Z","updated_at":"2026-04-25T12:36:09Z","body":"No engine bug in here, works as expected, the issue is a faulty user logic.\n\n`shape_active` is false so the Label's text is not being updated. To see it in action you can change `flaunt_tribute` in the MRP to:\n```gdscript\nfunc flaunt_tribute(shape):\n\tprint()\n\tprint_stack()\n\tprint(\" shape_active = %s\" % [shape_active])\n\tif shape_active:\n\t\ttribute_label.text = shape_tribute[shape]\n```\n\nBefore opening/reporting an issue please firstly try ensuring the issue is not on your side (like in here). There are [many community platforms](https://godotengine.org/community/) you can ask for help with your projects in.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://ap